Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.14,eva engrish,Tech1,0015,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Start entry sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.85,eva engrish,Tech2,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Initializing LCL ionization.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.02,eva engrish,Tech1,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Plug depth stable at default value.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.81,eva engrish,Tech1,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Autonomous systems are go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:50.40,eva engrish,Tech2,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Boot-up voltage has cleared the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:52.44,eva engrish,Tech2,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Launch prerequisites achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.20,eva engrish,Tech1,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Synchronization rate requirements are go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:56.24,eva engrish,Tech2,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:59.49,eva engrish,Tech2,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Please specify linguistic norm for cognitive functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:04.00,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, it's my first time, so... Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:04.71,eva engrish,Tech1,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.30,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So, the new plug suit wasn't provided on time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.10,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,This suit is tight around my chest, I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:20.64,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sorry about sending you into combat in the provisional unit on such short notice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:24.70,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I finally get to pilot, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:26.02,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's because you're a troublemaker.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.61,0:01:27.65,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well, it's in your hands now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.35,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It's moving, it's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:32.74,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,This is great... I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:38.91,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Alright.  Provisional Evangelion Unit 05.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:39.54,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.51,eva engrish,Commander,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1\1c&HB9B9B9&}Defend the limbo area at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:57.97,eva engrish,Commander,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1\1c&HB9B9B9&\pos(645,518)}We cannot allow it to escape from Acheron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.30,eva engrish,Commander,0020,0000,0000,,{\1c&HFAFAF8&\bord0\blur0.2\pos(637,521)}How could a containment system as secure as Cocytus be neutralized?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:05.43,eva engrish,Kaji,0020,0000,0000,,{\1c&HFAFAF8&\bord0\blur0.2}It was within the realm of possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:10.44,eva engrish,Kaji,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1\pos(640,519)}On its own, humanity is incapable of holding the Angels in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.86,eva engrish,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}The analysis pulling a permafrost extraction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:18.74,eva engrish,Kaji,0010,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}of the Third Angel was so extensive,\Nall that what was left were the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.53,eva engrish,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}And that was the conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.24,eva engrish,Kaji,0020,0000,0000,,{\bord0\blur0.1}With that said, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:28.56,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness doesn't walk to you~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:32.91,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I walk to it~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:37.28,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,One step a day, making three steps in three days~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:41.55,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Three steps forward, and two steps back~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:45.76,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Life is a one-two punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.20,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh, here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.14,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Activate A.T. field!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:59.44,eva engrish,Operator,0020,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF2EBE5&\3c&HC5C5C5&\bord0.1\blur0.5\pos(644,518)}Target inbound.\NEVA Unit 05 is about to engage the hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.21,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to move in this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:18.96,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'll have to use brute force!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:34.19,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HCFCFCD&\bord0\blur0.1}Upper outer wall integrity compromised!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.36,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HCFCFCD&\bord0\blur0.1}The final seal is about to be breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.49,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF1EBEE&\bord0\blur0.1}Target has broken through limbo area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.24,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF1EBEE&\bord0\blur0.1}Now moving into Acheron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.37,eva engrish,Commander,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF1EBEE&\bord0\blur0.1}Get Unit 05 to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:54.93,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.15,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.97,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It really hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:09.18,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,But it's fun, so whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:14.95,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:19.02,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,This unit won't hold, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:24.15,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,These spare limbs were forcefully synchronized, they don't have enough power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.76,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:36.00,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you have an arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.21,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:47.43,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,... die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:02.53,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HE8E5EC&\bord0\blur0.1\pos(631,590)}Target obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.57,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HE8E5EC&\bord0\blur0.1\pos(637,590)}Unit 05 has been vaporized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:06.74,eva engrish,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HE8E5EC&\bord0\blur0.1}Pilot appears to have been ejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:11.24,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,So, Unit 05's self-destruct program was successfully activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:17.37,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Though, I'm not so sure about involving a kid in the affairs of adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:25.59,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Ow ow ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:29.26,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't say synchronizing with an EVA would be this intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.61,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:41.98,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not so sure about involving\Nan adult to achieve my own goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.90,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell, EVA Unit 05.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:47.86,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,You did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:05.46,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It's been three years since the two of us last came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:11.85,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I ran away that day, and never came back here since.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:15.85,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I have no recollection at all that Mom was buried here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.89,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even remember her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:22.10,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,People live on by forgetting their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:26.14,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,But, there are memories that should never be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:29.20,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yui taught me that invaluable lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:32.74,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I come here to remind myself of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:35.79,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't there any pictures of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.91,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:40.62,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,This graveyard is just for appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.21,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,There is no body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:46.17,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,You threw everything away, just like my teacher said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:49.04,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It's all inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.51,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,That will do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.39,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.  I'll head back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.15,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:09.86,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:14.20,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad that I was able to talk to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:16.37,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Shinji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.20,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You were worried about all sorts of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.08,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,but they weren't so bad once you met him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:08.40,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you glad that you came instead of sulking at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:11.00,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's the anniversary of your mother's death, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.75,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's only because you forced me to, Misato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:17.43,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's because deep down inside you, Shinji-kun, you wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.22,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Be more honest with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.27,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Being honest only results in painful thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:26.16,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You lived up to everyone's expectations and saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.90,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Have more confidence in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:34.03,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure your father was proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.07,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,This is Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:43.45,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.65,eva,Nerv guy,0000,0000,0000,,The Seventh Angel has been detected off the coast of Sakami Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.00,eva,Nerv guy,0000,0000,0000,,The 2nd fleet is currently engaging the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:18.84,eva,Nerv guy,0000,0000,0000,,A state of emergency was declared 3 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:21.50,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I also have visual confirmation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.54,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I am currently transporting the pilot of Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.91,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Activate Task 03 on Unit 00 immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:29.63,eva,Nerv guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Can't do that, Task 02 is already in progress.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:30.80,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Task 02?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:31.60,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:40.98,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0\fscx150} {\r}Unit 02!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:18.30,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, she took out the core in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.50,eva alt,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's a decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.94,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Situation resolved!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The blocking-off of all designated areas is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:23.41,eva,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Currently, EVA Unit 02 is being\Ntransported via Route 1 from Sagami.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.44,eva,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It will arrive at the 4th Depot on time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:28.95,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, so Unit 02 is red?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:31.33,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's not just the coloring that makes it different!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:36.37,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,After all, Unit 00 is just a prototype and Unit 01 is only a test type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:38.30,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,But, Unit 02 is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:43.91,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Designed specifically for combat, it's the world's first genuine Evangelion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:45.27,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,The official type!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:49.97,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Introducing the ace of the European Air Force, Captain Shikinami Asuka Langley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:54.15,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,She's the Second Child, and the pilot of EVA Unit 02.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.86,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Misato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:04.36,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,So she's the Commander's pet who was chosen to be the pilot of Unit 00.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:09.87,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,And?  Who's the Daddy's boy who was chosen to be the pilot of Unit 01?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:11.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.03,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:18.30,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,How irresponsible of you to not be around during such a crucial time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:21.80,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What's worse, you're not even alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.55,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're not even ashamed despite missing a chance to fight in an EVA unit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:30.14,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It really {\i1}is{\i0\fscx150} {\r}thanks to your father you're a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.85,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, who's that girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:36.22,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Does she have a screw loose or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.85,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Though, it's amazing she's already a captain despite being our age!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:42.44,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,It's too amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.15,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,She must've skipped grades and graduated from university!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:46.24,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:50.94,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Do I pass the barrier to the platform here to reach the Geofront Hub Terminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:51.95,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:54.87,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,You can change trains at the station four stops ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:59.75,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I was only away for two years, but it feels like I've been away for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:02.13,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.  You really helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:05.14,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, aren't you with Katsuragi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.60,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,She's an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:13.27,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the only one who knows how bad she looks when she's sleeping, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:19.70,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,How she looks when she's sleeping, he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:21.36,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.15,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,No no, it was quite the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:29.20,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,The problematic Third Angel and EVA Unit 05 were dealt with, as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.85,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,We're insisting it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:34.54,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,With this, Betania Base's Marduk Project will be set back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.71,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Everything is going according to your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:40.04,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,And, I sent the usual new information on Seele earlier{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.30,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,We've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:45.58,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,The info on the construction of Mark. 06 was very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:46.59,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:49.04,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,This is the promised item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.30,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's the Lost Number kept as a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.27,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,The guidepost to unify souls unto God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.03,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this will open the door to Human Instrumentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:05.22,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,The Key of Nebuchadnezzar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:09.01,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll be doing my own thing for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:16.25,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Kaji Ryouji, Chief Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.08,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Can we trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.03,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Have you lost some weight, Ricchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:32.20,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.  I've put on 1,570 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:34.91,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to confirm that with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:37.84,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind, but this room is under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:41.59,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.  I've already popped in a dummy tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:44.19,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,You cover your bases, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.20,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I just don't like losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.65,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,But you already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:51.86,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,That terrifying woman is watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.37,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Ryou-chan, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:57.30,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:14:59.95,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.41,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you supposed to be in Europe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.51,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Special assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.30,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be here at Headquarters for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:07.30,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,The three of us can hang out together again, just like when we were in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:10.46,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I have no intention of going back to the old days!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.55,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I just have some business with Ritsuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:15.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I've already let the Human Resources Department know about Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:16.22,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:20.65,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Misato's clearly jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.98,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Ryou-chan, you have a chance with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:25.31,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:34.37,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Shikinami... Asuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.41,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,So there are actually people who happily pilot EVAs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.58,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.33,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.49,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,My room!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:46.96,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.39,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,That's my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:48.84,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.67,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Then what about mine?  Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.72,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here, Shikinami?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.60,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:58.80,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It means that you're being trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:03.60,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it doesn't take much to conclude who's the superior pilot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.00,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:08.52,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Though, why are the rooms in Japan so small?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.57,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fit even half my things in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:16.00,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Also, why do Japanese people have no sense of fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:18.51,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,They can actually live in a room with no lock on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:19.74,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.50,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it is a Japanese virtue to be considerate and respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.23,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.50,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.94,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and get out of here with all your trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:32.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Shin-chan will continue staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.37,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Whaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:37.65,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What both of you lack are adequate communication skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:40.84,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,As fellow pilots, you'll share in many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.56,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So you better get along!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:44.43,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.36,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.36,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:08.63,eva,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:17.18,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Man, beer really is best after a shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:22.76,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,S-Some sort of weird creature is in the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:27.21,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's a penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.50,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,His name is Pen-pen{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:42.61,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You pervert!  Idiot!  Letch!  Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:45.83,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(640,697)}You're both becoming more honest with each other.  Things are going nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:45.83,eva alt,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(640,598)}This is why I hate guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.42,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Pen-pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:02.76,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm different from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.97,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm special!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:08.28,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:12.09,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,... you can rely on yourself, Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:36.87,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you wouldn't answer, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.21,0:20:03.76,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Kaji's organizing a social studies field trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:06.22,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he also said to invite everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.54,0:20:09.35,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing good comes from being involved with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.57,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:14.75,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, "make peace and listen".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:15.80,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka, you're going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:18.02,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Is that also an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:31.55,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,We're right in front of the Tabgha lunar base, but they still won't authorize a landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.95,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,SEELE is playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:37.46,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,The construction method of Mark. 06 is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:39.79,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to confirm that is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:44.35,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But there shouldn't have been any plans for anything beyond Unit 05.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:48.58,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It is possible that undisclosed Dead Sea Scrolls Apocrypha exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:52.43,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,SEELE intends to use them to advance their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:59.04,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But, even SEELE must realize by now what NERV's ultimate objective is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:03.53,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, we have no choice but to continue forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:07.33,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we are to oppose the will of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.08,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,A person?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:15.54,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.38,eva,Kaworu,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:19.75,eva,Kaworu,0000,0000,0000,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:22.95,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!  This is too cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.90,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,The preservation of extinct marine animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:28.60,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,and the restoration of the\Nred stained sea to its original state!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:32.75,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,This is a forbidden sanctuary that conducts experiments of divine magnitudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:36.13,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to visit even a small part of it is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:38.76,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,It's like the saying, "That's what friends are for"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:40.67,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta give ya my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:42.90,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Kaji-san's the one you should be thanking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.74,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, things will get quite complicated from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:57.22,eva,All,0000,0000,0000,,Oww, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:03.62,eva,All,0000,0000,0000,,Brrr, cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:06.67,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Blugh... this again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.87,0:22:09.59,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Noo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.72,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:21.83,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:23.15,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,It's a huge aquarium!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:24.11,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:30.61,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Are these animals that lived before the Second Impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:41.83,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Woah!  They're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:43.96,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!  This is too awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:47.07,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh, that animal has something on its back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:48.34,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,I think they're called turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:49.19,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Turtles?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.19,0:22:51.01,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Getting all excited like a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:52.51,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:05.23,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.07,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:11.28,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I was able to come today,\Nsince I finished my assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:14.88,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cramped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:17.62,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if they had more space to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:18.58,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:21.87,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,These little ones can't live outside this tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:24.45,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:35.22,eva,All,0000,0000,0000,,I'm digging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.88,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's surprisingly good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:41.76,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.  Nice job with the grilling and seasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.03,0:23:47.74,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,It's unbelievable how meat that is 90% artificial could taste so good depending on how it's prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.94,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji, you've been hiding your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:54.99,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san only has instant food, so I had to learn how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:58.21,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, men who can cook get all the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:23:59.77,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:01.62,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,I won't cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:03.10,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Real men don't cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.29,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're being old-fashioned, how stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:06.17,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Whatcha say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.41,0:24:08.11,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Ya gotta live by ya principles!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.11,0:24:09.58,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're only making yourself look dumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:10.79,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Whatcha say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.44,eva alt,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, just eat, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.75,0:24:17.93,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Ayanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:19.64,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't like the taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:22.56,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,No.  I just don't eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.63,0:24:25.69,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Why do the Japanese apologize even if they didn't do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:29.48,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,And you!  Living things eat other living things to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:32.40,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to eat every last bit of it so that it didn't die for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:37.03,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, pet?  Wanna fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:41.44,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, comin' through...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.91,0:24:44.08,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, allow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:47.04,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,What?  I'm not giving you any!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.42,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,You're one greedy brat!  Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.42,0:24:50.67,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:52.55,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:56.05,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Then, how about some Miso soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.51,0:25:00.68,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It'll warm you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.81,0:25:13.82,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.86,0:25:17.07,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,To think that this is Mother Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:19.74,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's so heart-wrenching I can't even look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.69,0:25:24.50,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,However, there are people who wished for this disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:30.84,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,An world cleansed of the original sin that no man can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.41,0:25:35.85,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I prefer a chaotic world that has been corrupted by man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.85,0:25:38.75,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Chaos is in the eye of the beholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.75,0:25:42.10,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Everything in the world is built upon harmony and regularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.89,0:25:46.31,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,So, it's the human heart that\Nthrows the world into chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:53.44,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine that this ocean was blue before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.44,0:25:58.28,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Even the simple restoration of this environment to one that humans can live in was quite the feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.47,0:26:00.41,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But, this sea breeze...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.53,0:26:04.58,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,... has a strange, fishy smell to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:07.25,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's the smell of rotting marine life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.25,0:26:09.08,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's proof they are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.62,0:26:11.54,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that mass of red water with nothing in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:14.84,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,This is what the sea used to look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.45,0:26:19.88,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Originally, the world was wide, and filled with all kinds of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.22,0:26:23.35,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted you guys to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:25.27,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:27.82,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san should've come with us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.12,0:26:29.77,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi wouldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.35,0:26:31.48,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It'll prompt her to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:32.98,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:35.90,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,The Second Impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.44,0:27:23.61,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know why Katsuragi joined NERV?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.33,0:27:31.79,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi's father was a man who lived in his research and his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.79,0:27:34.00,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,She resented him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.25,0:27:36.96,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I think she despised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.17,0:27:39.01,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So, you don't get along with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.01,0:27:40.21,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.47,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's just like me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.43,0:27:47.68,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,But in the end, she was saved by the very father she resented.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.81,0:27:52.06,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Being a survivor means many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.51,0:27:57.15,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You must accept the sacrifices of the dead, and carry on their wills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.44,0:27:59.78,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,This is all the more so if you are alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.07,0:28:03.40,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the only one who's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.15,0:28:11.82,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,The Mauna Kea Observatory detected the target three minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.82,0:28:13.90,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Now inputting trajectory data.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.90,0:28:16.99,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Surveillance Satellite 3 has\Nobtained visuals of the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.99,0:28:18.12,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Displaying at highest magnification.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.29,0:28:23.97,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,An A.T. field so powerful it can bend light...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.97,0:28:25.05,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.59,0:28:27.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what is the estimated point of impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.89,0:28:30.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:35.40,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Based on Magi's re-estimate, the probability of it striking NERV Headquarters is at six nines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:45.03,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,The N2 aerial mines have no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.52,0:28:47.45,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So, we can't change its orbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.45,0:28:50.60,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's overconcentrating its A.T. field at one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.85,0:28:53.29,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,This will add to the energy of the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.45,0:28:56.22,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,This means the Angel itself is a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:29:00.71,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The estimated blast size from the Eighth Angel's impact is 420,000 meters wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.01,0:29:03.42,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,and 15,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.42,0:29:05.74,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Tokyo-3 would be completely annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.74,0:29:09.53,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,The GeoFront and even Central Dogma would be completely exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.53,0:29:10.43,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,And Commander Ikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.43,0:29:13.57,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The Angel is interfering with the radio waves in the upper atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.57,0:29:14.97,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,We are unable to contact him at present.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:18.60,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,We'll have to deal with this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.73,0:29:23.74,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Notify the Japanese government and each ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.74,0:29:27.19,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I am issuing Order D-17 on behalf of NERV.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.19,0:29:31.19,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Begin the evacuation of all civilians within a 120 kilometer radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.19,0:29:32.41,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:36.12,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Government officials have already begun the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.61,0:29:53.61,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Evacuation of civilians in the city is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.03,0:30:00.03,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Evacuation of noncombatants and Class D personnel signaled by Departmental Alarm C is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.03,0:30:02.74,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The backing-up of Magi has been left to Matsushiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.95,0:30:04.78,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,And?  What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.78,0:30:08.19,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The EVAs may be strong, but they can't fly in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.19,0:30:12.13,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,Sniping it down is impossible from all points due to massive spatial distortions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.13,0:30:15.04,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing we can do\Nagainst such an absurd enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:22.59,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,You're serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:24.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.33,0:30:26.38,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Can you even call this strategy a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.01,0:30:30.86,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Magi predicts a failure rate of over 99 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.86,0:30:33.89,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we succeed, we risk losing three EVAs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.18,0:30:37.05,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,As the Chief of Engineering, I won't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.05,0:30:38.85,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The probability of success is not zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.17,0:30:41.73,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Steady effort trumps waiting for a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.73,0:30:44.41,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Protecting Lilith and Unit-01 should be our top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.41,0:30:45.90,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not waiting for a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.90,0:30:47.82,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make it happen though human determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:49.19,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Colonel Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.03,0:30:53.87,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I am the commanding officer here.  I will make the decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.59,0:30:57.88,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Furthermore, it is my duty to annihilate the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:31:00.62,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Duty?  Don't you mean grudge?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.08,0:31:03.17,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,You want revenge against the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.55,0:31:04.56,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:06.01,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna stop it with our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.01,0:31:06.85,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.85,0:31:10.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to directly stop the incoming Angel by maximizing your A.T. fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:13.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The target is distorting any information on its position,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:16.69,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,so we cannot count on estimates based on optical observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.69,0:31:19.55,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So that we can respond to the situation and cover all sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:22.55,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,this strategy will involve the\Nsimultaneous launch of all three EVAs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.55,0:31:23.43,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.43,0:31:25.10,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I can annihilate the Angel by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.11,0:31:26.18,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:30.32,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The predicted area of impact cannot be covered by a single EVA unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.61,0:31:32.95,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,What is the basis for this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.16,0:31:34.24,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Woman's intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.43,0:31:35.91,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What a shot in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:37.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... likelihood of success?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.25,0:31:39.91,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Only God would know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:43.15,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!  That's why the other EVAs would only get in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.15,0:31:46.41,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I by myself am fully capable of saving mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.41,0:31:50.26,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,This operation does not rest on the outcomes of single combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:52.42,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean you disapprove of my ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.42,0:31:53.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:56.21,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I simply need the strength of all three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.95,0:31:58.47,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,In order to achieve a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.47,0:32:01.23,eva,Female Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All EVAs are being powered externally.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.23,0:32:03.05,eva,Female Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the power sources.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.72,0:32:06.48,eva,Man Op,0000,0000,0000,,{Number 305 ??? is complete.  Couldn't catch all of this line.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.48,0:32:08.98,eva,Man Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Connection with the New Gotenba substation complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.98,0:32:09.69,eva,Man Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Initiating insertion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.69,0:32:12.98,eva,Female Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The external power supply of\NUnit 00 has exceeded 105 percent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.98,0:32:15.08,eva,Female Op2,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Attaching backup power extension cables.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.07,0:32:17.91,eva,Female Op,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Squad 8, please hurry with the attachment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.08,0:32:21.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unit 01 connector link checked.  No problems.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.89,0:32:23.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All pilots are on standby.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:25.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Breathing rates and heart rates are at normal levels.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:27.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems in the final medical examinations.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:30.76,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Inside the EVA...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:35.08,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder why?  I'm surprisingly calm at times like this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.23,0:32:38.55,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Has piloting become natural to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.54,0:32:40.43,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder why?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.17,0:32:42.98,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It feels familiar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.17,0:32:45.01,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A scent?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.23,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The scent of my mother?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.74,0:32:50.61,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ayanami's scent?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.61,0:32:54.03,eva,Operator,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Currently estimating the trajectory of the target.  Input variables...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.03,0:32:55.26,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.21,0:32:57.91,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,All EVA units, starting positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.71,0:33:10.34,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Because secondary data won't be reliable, you will all be operating on your own. {your personal on-the-stage judgements will be priority}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.34,0:33:13.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Everything depends on the three of you, and the EVAs you pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.25,0:33:15.38,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Target is approaching.  Distance: 20,000 meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.68,0:33:16.23,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.47,0:33:17.55,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Begin the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.92,0:33:19.67,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.03,0:33:54.05,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The target's A.T. field type has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.05,0:33:55.51,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Its trajectory has shifted!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.51,0:33:57.53,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Estimated impact point, revised to 205.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.53,0:33:58.88,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Target is accelerating!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.88,0:34:01.22,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?!  It's much faster than was estimated!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.22,0:34:03.02,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,No good, I can't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:04.67,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:05.31,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.31,0:34:08.04,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Form an emergency course, 605 to 675.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.04,0:34:08.26,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.24,0:34:18.58,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Next, 1027 to 1078!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:19.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Standby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.74,0:35:01.99,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The target has transformed!  Distance: 12,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.16,0:35:08.82,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A.T. field, full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.07,0:35:45.20,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy's boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:47.20,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 02, the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.20,0:35:48.16,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.58,0:35:51.49,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:35:58.67,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It came off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.19,0:36:01.46,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You just don't know when to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.73,0:36:02.55,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,30 seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.52,0:36:14.73,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:16.59,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I said I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.58,0:36:21.78,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,The Commander's pet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:26.41,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.41,0:36:27.45,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.45,0:36:32.66,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I already say I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.33,0:36:37.88,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.06,0:37:37.21,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Situation resolved.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.21,0:37:38.92,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.55,0:37:40.98,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Communication systems restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.98,0:37:43.28,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Incoming call from Commander Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.28,0:37:44.16,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Connect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.08,0:37:47.44,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.44,0:37:50.26,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The three EVA units have been damaged under my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.26,0:37:52.63,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The pilots have also sustained injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.63,0:37:54.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I will assume all responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.33,0:37:56.25,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's fine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.25,0:38:01.42,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It is fortunate that you managed to stop the target with only this much damage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:05.01,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Indeed.  Well done, Colonel Katsuragi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.01,0:38:06.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:08.34,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Connect me with the pilot of Unit 01.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.61,0:38:09.13,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.25,0:38:11.80,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I heard about the situation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.80,0:38:13.51,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well done, Shinji.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.82,0:38:15.52,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.11,0:38:17.59,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well then, Colonel Katsuragi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:19.18,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I will leave the rest to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.18,0:38:19.56,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes, sir.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.18,0:38:22.38,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Recover the three EVA units.  Hurry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.38,0:38:25.48,eva,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Bring in Unit 01 first, to Emergency Cage 99.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:37.20,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't do anything... on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.47,0:39:11.23,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Though it's always been normal for me to be alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.78,0:39:16.32,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Though being alone shouldn't bother me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.22,0:39:30.91,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, wha{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:32.26,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.45,0:39:36.98,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... o-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.36,0:39:42.14,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Let me stay here just a little, Daddy's boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.56,0:39:51.09,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Shikinami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.63,0:39:57.33,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,During today's turmoil, you called me by my first name, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.37,0:40:00.29,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,As a treat, you can call me Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.98,0:40:03.42,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll also call you Idiot Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.66,0:40:06.01,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.41,0:40:09.32,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka, why do you pilot EVA?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.32,0:40:10.67,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,That's a stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:13.23,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Just be quiet, Idiot Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.23,0:40:15.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.93,0:40:20.71,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I pilot EVA for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:23.69,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.16,0:40:25.77,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:28.77,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:31.86,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,That's just running away from your responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.44,0:40:36.16,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I want to be praised by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.62,0:40:41.54,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,He praised me for the first time in my life today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.83,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I believe it's the first time praise has made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:50.25,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my father finally approves of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.09,0:40:53.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's just like Misato-san said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.28,0:40:59.56,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.25,0:41:01.81,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,... really {\i1}are{\i0\fscx150} {\r}stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.33,0:41:09.10,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, food, food!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.10,0:41:11.62,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,It's the best thing 'bout being in school!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.62,0:41:14.36,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What?  You don't have our packed lunches with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:17.48,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I was busy doing homework this morning, so I didn't have time to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.48,0:41:22.19,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,So, you're telling {\i1}me{\i0\fscx150} {\r}to spend my lunch without food?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.19,0:41:24.34,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, I'll make it tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.51,0:41:27.37,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?  Married couple quarrelin' again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.54,0:41:29.71,eva,Both,0000,0000,0000,,We're not married!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.77,0:41:35.37,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka, lend me your facial cleanser.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:37.15,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Stop using mine, Misato!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.15,0:41:38.68,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Go buy your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.22,0:41:40.63,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Cheapskate!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:44.65,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, food, food!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.09,0:41:47.85,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm diggin' in!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.48,0:41:52.22,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.22,0:41:54.17,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's lost some flavor from his slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.17,0:41:55.86,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Asuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.32,0:41:56.82,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.82,0:41:59.07,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Can I eat with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.07,0:42:03.83,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome to, but I'm not sharing my lunch with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:09.00,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.00,0:42:14.05,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like you never eat, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.14,0:42:18.30,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,T-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.30,0:42:21.34,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I decided to ask to join you{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.87,0:42:21.34,eva alt,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Your name's Hikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.66,0:42:24.48,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You can have what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.85,0:42:28.14,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I'm so full.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.05,0:42:30.58,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.15,0:42:32.90,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,That's a pretty late lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.25,0:42:34.32,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.23,0:42:37.94,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I heard Shinji-kun's been making your meals?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.94,0:42:41.16,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you were never much of a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.91,0:42:44.73,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.28,0:42:49.90,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Unlike you, I don't have much free time, with all this work I have to do as director.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.90,0:42:52.12,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You're hardworking, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.25,0:42:55.96,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's one of your qualities,\NKatsuragi, but it's also a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.96,0:42:59.47,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that you fell out with Ricchan a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.09,0:43:02.01,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't take things so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.01,0:43:06.24,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, my schedule is always full of obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.24,0:43:09.39,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,If you're too stressed, you won't get any guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.39,0:43:11.35,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's none of your business{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.68,0:43:33.58,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,"Thank you".
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.62,0:43:35.75,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Words of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.63,0:43:37.92,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Words I've never used.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.67,0:43:43.63,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I've never said them to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.17,0:43:45.98,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.64,0:43:48.60,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.38,0:43:50.35,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Take your seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:55.27,eva,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami's absent again?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.78,0:43:56.47,eva,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.47,0:43:59.32,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She seemed fine yesterday.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.49,0:44:01.44,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder what's wrong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.82,0:44:02.87,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.97,0:44:05.88,eva,shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Can't live anywhere but here".{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.74,0:44:08.12,eva,shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What did she mean by that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.28,0:44:14.17,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:21.21,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.41,0:44:23.13,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.10,0:44:31.27,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Commander Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.92,0:44:32.98,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.39,0:44:35.77,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Are meals fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.52,0:44:37.27,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.43,0:44:41.94,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Do you enjoy eating with others?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.40,0:44:44.11,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:50.08,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Does it make you happy to have food cooked for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.74,0:44:51.54,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.71,0:44:56.00,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Commander Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.50,0:45:01.80,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, would you like to have a meal with Ikari-kun and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.22,0:45:06.22,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't have the ti{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.39,0:45:13.10,eva,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Darling, please take care of Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.95,0:45:21.40,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Alright.  I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.41,0:45:26.85,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There are no abnormalities for all pilots in the synchronization test.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.85,0:45:29.04,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Degree of mental contamination not estimated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.41,0:45:34.04,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Aah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.04,0:45:36.12,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is boring.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.12,0:45:38.84,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All we do is run tests when Angels aren't coming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.84,0:45:39.96,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What a shame.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.96,0:45:42.00,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.00,0:45:47.58,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,We fight, hoping for calm days where Angels won't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:50.10,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Today's the same as yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.10,0:45:51.96,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,And tomorrow will be the same as today.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.96,0:45:54.27,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,An eulogy to the endless cycle of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.27,0:45:57.10,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,If anything, it's a situation we should be thankful for.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.24,0:45:59.57,eva,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Test is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.57,0:46:01.52,eva,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Results are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.52,0:46:02.96,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Good work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.96,0:46:05.23,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The three of you can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.37,0:46:16.39,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if I should say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.39,0:46:20.41,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,but the damage we've sustained could hinder our using them for further battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.41,0:46:23.24,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't we just disregard the Vatican Treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.24,0:46:24.57,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.57,0:46:30.04,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The limit of three EVA units per country leaves us with no spare units to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.04,0:46:33.30,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Our current priority is to repair Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.30,0:46:36.26,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,We're barely managing this even though we're using all the spare parts we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.26,0:46:39.31,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,so the prospect of repairing Unit 00 is grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.63,0:46:42.86,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The treaty involves the egos of each country.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.86,0:46:45.12,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Trying to revise it is close to impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.12,0:46:47.71,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,What's more, despite having lost Unit 05,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.71,0:46:50.79,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Europe and Russia are involving Asia in their various demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.79,0:46:53.57,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Things get more troublesome when politics is involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.07,0:46:57.37,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,There's too much to be done before we can even get to saving mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.27,0:47:08.27,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.44,0:47:14.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.99,0:47:28.64,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,My glasses...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.70,0:47:30.57,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.50,0:47:32.83,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.83,0:47:33.80,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.08,0:47:38.37,eva engrish,Mari,0023,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}Hello, Mari here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.95,0:47:41.96,eva engrish,Mari,0020,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}Yes, I seem to have landed off-target.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.75,0:47:45.46,eva engrish,Mari,0020,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}It looks like I'm in a school of some sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.25,0:47:46.88,eva engrish,Mari,0015,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.42,0:47:50.63,eva engrish,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}Well, you told me to enter into Japan covertly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.72,0:47:53.88,eva engrish,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}Can't you have your people work this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.01,0:47:58.51,eva engrish,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&HF4F7F8&\bord0\blur0.1}Just be there for my extraction later, okay?  Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:08.72,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,You smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.14,0:48:11.07,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It's the smell of LCL.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.67,0:48:15.71,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,You're interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.28,0:48:19.87,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Well, don't tell anyone about this, NERV's puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.58,0:48:33.59,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.20,0:48:42.64,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Yo!  Why don't we go on a date sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:45.48,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But, I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.48,0:48:46.90,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.48,0:48:50.82,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Gender has nothing to do with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.12,0:48:56.28,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:48:59.12,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.08,0:49:14.55,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,The scent of the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:16.63,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Worn out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.09,0:49:20.10,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You're working for your salary, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.70,0:49:21.85,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Salary?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.31,0:49:24.62,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,You mean the canned coffee from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.62,0:49:27.77,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, you said this was a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.61,0:49:31.27,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were more serious than that, Kaji-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.57,0:49:35.02,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,For an adult, being crafty is just about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:41.79,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Are these really watermelons?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.03,0:49:44.07,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.  Aren't they cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.07,0:49:45.33,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's my hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.93,0:49:49.50,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,To create and grow something is a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.07,0:49:52.82,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You can see all sorts of things, and learn from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.82,0:49:54.34,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Fun things, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.75,0:49:57.51,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Painful things too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:00.09,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You dislike painful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.87,0:50:02.43,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.79,0:50:04.55,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Have you found something you enjoy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.32,0:50:08.56,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.88,0:50:14.23,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,However, only people who understand pain know how to be kind to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.23,0:50:16.66,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's different from being weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.61,0:50:20.57,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like Katsuragi?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:26.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san?  Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.96,0:50:28.04,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't dislike her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.04,0:50:31.24,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Protect Katsuragi for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.91,0:50:35.46,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.91,0:50:37.76,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's something only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:40.47,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.83,0:51:11.87,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.20,0:51:14.00,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.00,0:51:15.31,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,She greeted us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.31,0:51:17.42,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:21.84,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, are you okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.17,0:51:24.09,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm fine today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.66,0:51:27.39,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.47,0:51:30.94,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Dr. Akagi bandaged it for me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.02,0:51:33.15,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What did she do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.64,0:51:34.60,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.15,0:51:38.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you once I get a little better at speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.83,0:51:50.72,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Rei's really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.72,0:51:51.66,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,She has.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.89,0:51:56.04,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It's unbelievable that the girl would do things for the sake of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.04,0:51:57.60,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.98,0:51:59.50,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it... love?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.51,0:52:02.14,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!  That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.67,0:52:10.14,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot Shinji would probably like it a little milder, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.55,0:52:11.97,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.43,0:52:13.85,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, Misato?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.85,0:52:15.18,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.18,0:52:17.79,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.  I have to go right back to Headquarters, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.79,0:52:19.73,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just back to take a bath and change my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.67,0:52:26.02,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.02,0:52:29.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So you're cooking for Shin-chan too, Asuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.38,0:52:31.11,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.11,0:52:32.31,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's, uh, for a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.31,0:52:33.25,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's for Hikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.25,0:52:37.08,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Pfft, what's with both you and Rei\Ngetting all romantic all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.08,0:52:39.75,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't put me together with that pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.76,0:52:44.05,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.  Rei seems to planning something grander.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.05,0:52:45.26,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.26,0:52:50.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to want to be the Cupid that will bring Shin-chan closer to Commander Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.30,0:52:55.41,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Her strategy seems to be a meal party where she does the cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.41,0:52:57.77,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Its straightforwardness might actually make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.36,0:53:02.95,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Getting father and son back on good terms will require a lot of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.95,0:53:05.40,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,She's doing all this for Idiot Shinji?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.40,0:53:08.48,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's meant to be a surprise for\NShin-chan, so don't let him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.18,0:53:12.74,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I won't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.48,0:53:36.62,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Annihilated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.59,0:53:40.44,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 04 and the Second Branch... annihilated?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.18,0:53:43.65,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,This is data from T plus ten, ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.31,0:53:46.28,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:49.94,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,We were able to confirm the breaking down of an A.T. field from a satellite,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.94,0:53:51.28,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,but the exact details are unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.29,0:53:54.08,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So Unit 04 was the epicenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.08,0:53:56.08,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Are our own EVA units fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.08,0:53:57.25,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 04 was{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.75,0:54:05.59,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 04 was a testbed model with a new internals designed to tackle problems with operation time length.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.85,0:54:07.05,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Or so it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.05,0:54:12.18,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The North American developmental details are not fully open, even for Dr. Akagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.65,0:54:14.18,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,And those who {\i1}do{\i0\fscx150} {\r}know...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.38,0:54:15.72,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 04.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.44,0:54:20.19,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,A test unit used to obtain developmental data for the next generation of EVAs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.68,0:54:22.89,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not surprising that something would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.34,0:54:24.15,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.56,0:54:29.11,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Was it really an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.93,0:55:02.10,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Ma'am, I'll take three!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.99,0:55:07.85,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,How rare of you to treat us, Touji.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.94,0:55:12.99,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think that you'd let me treat ya to a snack with us, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.99,0:55:17.14,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,You should just be honest and say that it's because your sister's health is improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.14,0:55:20.29,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Shaddup!  Ya didn't havta say that much, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.54,0:55:27.09,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.26,0:55:27.76,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.76,0:55:30.15,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,I heard Unit 03 is coming to Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.15,0:55:32.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Really?  I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.63,0:55:37.47,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,There are rumors that the US is forcing Japan to perform the activation experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.47,0:55:40.66,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not information that you pilots would need.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.66,0:55:42.60,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,But man, I wonder who will pilot it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.98,0:55:45.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know, I never heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.15,0:55:48.21,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Man, how nice it is to be a pilot!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.21,0:55:50.47,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if they'll let me become one?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.47,0:55:53.31,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Bugging me won't do anything,\NMisato-san's the one who decides...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.31,0:55:55.16,eva,Touji,0000,0000,0000,,Tch, I didn't win anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.60,0:56:10.51,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,We recently lost Evangelion Unit 05.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.88,0:56:14.24,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,Now, we've also lost Unit 04.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:18.59,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,The loss of both units will be a setback to the advancement of the project...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.59,0:56:20.40,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,It is within the scope of amendment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.40,0:56:21.77,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,There won't be any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.13,0:56:26.69,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,The US government is imploring you to take Unit 03.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.69,0:56:29.57,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,The government of your country has also been cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.57,0:56:31.23,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,It's a state-of-the-art weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.23,0:56:33.08,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,It'll serve your fighting needs nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:36.32,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,We are in the process of eliminating the Angels even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.32,0:56:39.12,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I do not have enough faith in an untested unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.31,0:56:43.41,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,If you could approve an increased budget to repair Unit 00{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.41,0:56:46.59,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,The role of the prototype model will soon end.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.59,0:56:47.96,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.17,0:56:51.67,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed, there are other matters that should be prioritized.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.94,0:56:54.93,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,The true Evangelion we desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.15,0:57:00.12,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,Its birth and Lilith's resurrection will signify the time of our covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.12,0:57:03.59,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,We must perform the necessary rituals before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.19,0:57:06.90,eva,Seele,0000,0000,0000,,For the Human Instrumentality Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.19,0:57:08.62,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.94,0:57:11.52,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It will all go according to your plan, SEELE.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.71,0:57:16.45,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,The true Evangelion...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.89,0:57:24.08,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,So, the purpose of the current units, including Unit 01, is to pave the way for its completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.30,0:57:26.66,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,And is that Mark. 06?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.24,0:57:32.17,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,So it's not false gods they want to create, but a true God at last?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.82,0:57:33.55,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.05,0:57:37.01,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,We must hasten the awakening of Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.66,0:57:42.37,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}EVA Unit 02's core unit separation complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.51,0:57:46.53,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Why is my Unit 02 being sealed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.53,0:57:49.15,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,You know about the Vatican Treaty, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.15,0:57:51.45,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,This is the condition for our receiving Unit 03.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.45,0:57:54.35,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you seal the damaged Unit 00 instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.35,0:57:58.16,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The pass for Unit 02 is still being held by Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.16,0:58:00.44,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing we can do about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.44,0:58:02.80,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Currently, its pilot has also been suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.80,0:58:06.41,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Please behave yourself until we receive further notice from Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.54,0:58:08.92,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Even though no one can pilot it but me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:10.83,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,EVA are combat weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.10,0:58:13.33,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,We have backups for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.63,0:58:15.30,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Including the pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.83,0:58:17.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.64,0:58:22.48,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,But it's the only place in the world for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.89,0:58:48.29,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,EVA is a mirror that reflects your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.42,0:58:49.41,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.41,0:58:51.21,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't rely on EVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.72,0:58:54.55,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,There is happiness to be found outside of piloting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.55,0:58:57.92,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you lecture me, you're just a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.37,0:59:04.63,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a prodigy, and I was chosen to pilot EVA due to my own merits!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.63,0:59:06.85,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Unlike you both, who got to pilot only because of connections!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.10,0:59:09.31,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm simply bonded to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.88,0:59:12.81,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm unable to bond to people without EVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.81,0:59:13.94,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.94,0:59:18.73,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You were only favored because you're a good doll who does whatever Commander Ikari wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.31,0:59:20.65,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.65,0:59:22.20,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.20,0:59:24.74,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Know a little more about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.85,0:59:37.96,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph.  You've got some nerve for a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.19,0:59:46.90,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Let me ask you just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.90,0:59:48.76,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about that idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.08,0:59:49.90,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.11,0:59:52.06,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm obviously talking about that idiot Shinji!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.54,0:59:53.47,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.37,0:59:55.44,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.23,0:59:57.82,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.82,0:59:59.89,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,This is what I hate about the Japanese!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.89,1:00:01.36,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Make yourself clear already!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.83,1:00:02.86,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.19,1:00:07.16,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,But, being with Ikari-kun makes me warm and content.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.78,1:00:11.24,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I want Ikari-kun to feel warm and content, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.87,1:00:16.88,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I want him to get along with Commander Ikari and feel warm and content, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.97,1:00:19.21,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.39,1:00:27.39,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You really are an ultra idiot beyond help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.54,1:00:29.85,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,That means you're in love with him!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.81,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I'm looking forward to the meal party.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.19,1:00:41.36,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Though, I wonder if Ayanami's cooking will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.06,1:00:47.43,eva,{SIGN,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if Father could come.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.48,1:00:52.70,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The first unmanned solo Dummy System test will commence at Cage 7...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.70,1:00:55.58,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's the Dummy System.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.58,1:00:58.49,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Although it was only supposed to assist the pilot,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.49,1:01:00.38,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,not only can it independently exert autonomous control,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.38,1:01:03.70,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,but it can even exert an A.T. field while unmanned.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.70,1:01:07.09,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,It's supposed to be more humane than forcing children to pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.59,1:01:16.81,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,There's just something about that new Dummy System thing that doesn't sit well with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.68,1:01:21.06,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's something that was tightly sealed and sent directly here from Golgotha Base,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.06,1:01:22.65,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,so none of us know what it really is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.10,1:01:28.16,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't understand why they'd let\Nsomething so dangerous control EVA!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.62,1:01:32.08,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You're saying that the control of EVA should be left to humans?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.16,1:01:35.41,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,You really trust Shinji-kun a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.41,1:01:38.37,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, you trust him {\i1}because{\i0\fscx150} {\r}he's Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.89,1:01:44.84,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That aside, could you give me some intel regarding SEELE, our higher-ups?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.46,1:01:49.01,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,If it's {\i1}that{\i0\fscx150} {\r}plan you're talking about, I suggest you pursue it no further.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.01,1:01:50.39,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.99,1:01:52.96,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The Human Instrumentality Project...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.96,1:01:55.06,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What on Earth is NERV is doing behind the scenes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.62,1:01:56.68,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.98,1:02:01.90,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.52,1:02:08.74,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's been so long since we've dined together, but all we talk about is work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.46,1:02:11.66,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Unlike when we were college students.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.13,1:02:15.75,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,We've learned many things, and carry more burdens.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.95,1:02:19.42,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,And so, the both of us can no longer be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.71,1:02:24.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun and the others have been made to carry much larger burdens.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.25,1:02:27.17,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.  It's too big of a burden for kids to carry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.58,1:02:30.68,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,But, we have no choice but to rely on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.11,1:02:37.93,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.84,1:02:40.61,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.23,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you an answer before the day ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.56,1:02:45.40,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Is that Ricchan?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.40,1:02:46.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.25,1:02:49.27,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,She keeps urging me to decide on the test pilot for Unit 03.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.27,1:02:51.60,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,That's because personnel selection is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.60,1:02:56.51,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's true, but the test date was rescheduled due to delays with Unit 03's arrival.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.04,1:03:00.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,And it just had to be that day, of all days...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:03.29,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 03's activation test date...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.33,1:03:06.63,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that also the date of that pet's meal party?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.20,1:03:36.49,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,I see.  Asuka it is, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.73,1:03:40.75,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll take the last flight to Matsushiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.25,1:03:43.05,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of things while I'm gone, Maya.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.05,1:03:44.27,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes, Ma'am!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.13,1:03:46.96,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Dr. Akagi?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.53,1:03:52.01,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I want to say to the Second Child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.99,1:03:54.22,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.53,1:04:08.20,eva,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You have one new voice message.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.61,1:04:10.65,eva,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is the first voice message.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.20,1:04:14.66,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Okay, Rei.  You can speak now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.37,1:04:28.00,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.81,1:04:34.10,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!  Is she stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.10,1:04:36.09,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It was just me wanting to pilot an EVA!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.60,1:04:44.74,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,If I end up liking Unit 03, please paint it red for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.12,1:04:49.40,eva,Hikari,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Aida-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.65,1:04:51.00,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Sup.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.26,1:04:52.46,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  Where's Touji?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.66,1:04:57.49,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,His sister is being discharged from Odawara Hospital today.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.28,1:04:59.83,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.18,1:05:01.46,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Touji has a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.68,1:05:06.29,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,"There's no need to worry.  My sister also appreciates it."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.04,1:05:10.05,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, isn't this just great?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.00,1:05:11.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.13,1:05:15.84,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you visiting Ayanami today?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.54,1:05:19.26,eva,Kensuke,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.98,1:05:32.03,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The director of the EVA Unit 03 manned activation test has arrived.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.03,1:05:33.65,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She is currently heading to the control room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.65,1:05:38.45,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Checks for the Provisional Ground Cage and the Restraint Systems are complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.96,1:05:38.45,eva up,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Begin Umbilical Cord connection.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.62,1:05:42.35,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Connector attachment confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.35,1:05:43.90,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Switchover to the main power source complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.91,1:05:45.54,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Internal voltage has cleared the required threshold.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.18,1:05:49.80,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Entry plug has been fixed in entry position.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.80,1:05:52.98,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Checklist clear through 1350.  No problems.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.98,1:05:55.15,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.  Begin countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.15,1:05:56.60,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Begin countdown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.60,1:05:58.48,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All ground crew are to evacuate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.48,1:06:00.57,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Medical examinations of test pilot complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.57,1:06:03.04,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The pilot is currently on standby in the mobile isolation room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.04,1:06:05.54,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I can leave the rest to Ritsuko now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.46,1:06:12.11,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The secret line?  Asuka?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.13,1:06:17.66,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Asuka?  Calling right before the test?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.66,1:06:21.28,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to talk to you for some reason, Misato.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.83,1:06:26.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.  I haven't properly thanked you for doing this yet, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.54,1:06:27.25,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.46,1:06:31.87,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.61,1:06:36.38,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It's simply the duty of the elite to protect the ignorant masses.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.23,1:06:40.38,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, having a meal with everyone was never really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.38,1:06:43.99,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Pretending to have fun with the others will only wear me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.34,1:06:46.73,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to see others be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.40,1:06:49.52,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I should just pilot EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.08,1:06:52.25,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I've always liked being alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:54.44,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I never needed close friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.93,1:06:58.32,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,There's never been anyone who sees me for who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:02.49,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I get top scores in this test, I can deal with eating alone at NERV.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.94,1:07:08.33,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Though, recently I've been thinking that it's nice to be around others.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:11.00,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's not like me to say that, though...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.00,1:07:12.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.04,1:07:14.54,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You're a kind girl, Asuka.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.75,1:07:18.02,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're the first person I've said this to, Misato.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.86,1:07:20.50,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.04,1:07:23.03,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good to talk to others.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.52,1:07:24.71,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I never knew...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.23,1:07:29.89,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,This world is full of interesting things you have yet to know about.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.29,1:07:31.44,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Look forward to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.93,1:07:34.97,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.44,1:07:36.99,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Misato.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.13,1:07:41.00,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, I like the red color,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.00,1:07:43.26,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,but isn't this Test Plug Suit...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.02,1:07:45.87,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,a little too revealing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.28,1:07:47.57,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Start entry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.57,1:07:50.21,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ionizing LCL.  Pressure is at normal levels.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.21,1:07:52.57,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}First excitation state is being maintained.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.57,1:07:54.26,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the plug sensor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.26,1:07:56.39,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Diagnostic values are within error ranges.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.39,1:07:59.19,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger.  Move on to Phase 2.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.19,1:08:00.68,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Begin secondary connection.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.43,1:08:02.76,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.76,1:08:05.00,eva,Asuka,0000,0000,0000,,I can actually smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.27,1:08:22.66,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,Plug depth is over 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.92,1:08:24.82,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,The risk of mental contamination has exceeded critical levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.13,1:08:26.16,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Why, all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.16,1:08:28.04,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,Plug depth has exceeded safety levels!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.04,1:08:28.99,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Restrain it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.99,1:08:31.41,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,If this continues, the pilot will no longer be human!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.41,1:08:33.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Abort the test!  Cut the circuits!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.75,1:08:36.50,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,No good.  A high-energy reaction from within the body!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.25,1:08:38.00,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.22,1:08:39.84,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,An Angel?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.28,1:08:47.93,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:55.94,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,An explosion incident at Matsushiro?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.14,1:09:05.35,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What's the extent of the damage?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.35,1:09:06.04,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.04,1:09:07.66,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,It seems that the explosion was\Ncentered on the provisional test cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.66,1:09:09.75,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,We've confirmed the destruction of the ground control facilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.75,1:09:12.65,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Send rescue teams and the Third Battalion to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.65,1:09:15.09,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of everything before the JSSDF intervenes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.09,1:09:15.71,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.71,1:09:18.87,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Unknown mobile object detected south-west of the blast site.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.87,1:09:19.91,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Pattern orange.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.17,1:09:21.96,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Unable to confirm whether it is an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.39,1:09:24.30,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Battle Stations One.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.30,1:09:25.30,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.30,1:09:27.97,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,All personnel, Battle Stations One.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.97,1:09:30.39,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Place the damaged Unit 00 on standby.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.39,1:09:33.97,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Fit Unit 01 with the Dummy Plug and send it out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.52,1:09:40.69,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tank Troop Five is positioned at the 18th defense perimeter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.69,1:09:44.40,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Two minutes until connection of the main power extension cable is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.40,1:09:46.68,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Deployment of the support strike force is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.68,1:09:49.99,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... how are Misato-san, Asuka, and the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.99,1:09:52.85,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We are currently doing our best to rescue them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.85,1:09:53.95,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.95,1:09:57.95,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But... Misato-san and the other EVAs aren't with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.95,1:10:00.17,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do this alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.78,1:10:02.54,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There won't be problems with the chain of command.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.54,1:10:05.26,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Commander Ikari himself has taken charge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.54,1:10:06.58,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.97,1:10:08.76,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,We have visual confirmation near the Toomi area.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.76,1:10:10.25,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring to the main monitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.86,1:10:17.34,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,We should've known.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.34,1:10:19.50,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Transmit the deactivation signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.50,1:10:21.48,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Eject the entry plug by force.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.08,1:10:25.04,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.04,1:10:28.44,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's not recognizing the deactivation signal or the ejection code!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.44,1:10:31.64,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,A core-like invasive structure around the entry plug area has been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:33.49,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Analysis pattern complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.49,1:10:34.37,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,It's blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.95,1:10:38.92,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit 3 is hereby abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.92,1:10:41.75,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Reclassify the target as the Ninth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.39,1:10:43.88,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Target is approaching.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.13,1:10:46.28,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Prepare for ground combat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:47.79,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Anti-invasion team, begin attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.01,1:10:50.93,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What?  That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.93,1:10:53.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}An Angel?  Is that an Angel?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.38,1:10:55.40,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.  That's our target.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.83,1:10:57.22,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Our target?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.49,1:11:00.39,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that an EVA?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.43,1:11:04.23,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:06.66,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The target is approaching.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.66,1:11:07.82,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You are to defeat it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.15,1:11:11.20,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But, even though that's the target...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.88,1:11:17.75,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't Asuka still inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.78,1:11:22.75,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.37,1:11:47.32,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.82,1:11:49.86,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,An entry plug...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.43,1:11:51.58,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,So she {\i1}is{\i0} in it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.80,1:12:30.07,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The armor is being contaminated at the cervical vertebrae block!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:32.82,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Contamination has been confirmed to have reached Layer 6,200!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.82,1:12:34.67,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,So it's a contamination-type Angel...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.67,1:12:35.74,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.16,1:12:38.21,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The A.T. field of Unit 01 is unstable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.21,1:12:40.16,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Life support systems are failing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.16,1:12:42.15,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The pilot's life will be in danger if this continues!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.39,1:12:45.79,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,We can't let this happen.\NCut the synchronization down to 28 percent!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.79,1:12:46.48,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.48,1:12:49.62,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But, Ikari, if this continues the pilot will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.62,1:12:51.80,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji, why aren't you fighting?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.30,1:12:55.64,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But Asuka's still inside, Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.64,1:12:58.14,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter.  That thing is an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.14,1:12:59.43,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.67,1:13:01.36,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.14,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I can't bring myself to kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.14,1:13:05.44,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Then you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.44,1:13:06.64,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.88,1:13:09.06,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's better than killing Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.45,1:13:10.45,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:13.12,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Cut all synchronization between the pilot and Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.12,1:13:13.83,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.83,1:13:14.95,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Cut them?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.95,1:13:15.96,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:17.95,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Switch control over to the Dummy System.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.95,1:13:21.63,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,But, there are still many problems with the Dummy System,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.63,1:13:23.62,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,and without Dr. Akagi's directions, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.62,1:13:26.04,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be of more use than the current pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.36,1:13:27.00,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.63,1:13:28.46,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.81,1:13:53.04,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.36,1:14:02.83,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Father?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.32,1:14:05.75,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Control system transfer complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.75,1:14:09.36,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All neural circuits have been\Nconnected to the Dummy System.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.36,1:14:13.04,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dummy System has at most\N208 seconds of active time remaining.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.04,1:14:14.07,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.07,1:14:16.56,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Release the system.  Commence the attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.56,1:14:18.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.11,1:14:50.79,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the power of the Dummy System?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.79,1:14:52.30,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dummy system nominal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.30,1:14:54.37,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Control limiters are being removed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:03.79,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What is this, Father...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.38,1:16:07.07,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What is this?  What are you doing?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.28,1:16:11.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.71,1:16:22.03,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.13,1:16:25.39,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.44,1:16:28.24,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.89,1:16:37.35,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}STOP!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.00,1:17:10.93,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.25,1:17:14.98,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Kaji?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.19,1:17:17.39,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,That's good, Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.25,1:17:19.31,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,How's Ritsuko?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.86,1:17:20.73,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.32,1:17:22.90,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Her injuries aren't as bad as yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.52,1:17:25.42,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.24,1:17:29.61,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What about Asuka?  EVA Unit 03?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.61,1:17:32.32,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,It's been dealt with as an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:34.12,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,By Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.47,1:17:47.89,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The linking circuits of Unit 01 have been cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.38,1:17:49.73,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,And the ejection signal?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.73,1:17:51.68,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's locked from inside the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.68,1:17:53.27,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,He's locked himself in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.27,1:17:54.69,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough, Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.69,1:17:56.90,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Think about what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.21,1:18:00.76,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Don't make me any angrier with those words.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.24,1:18:03.98,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There are still 285 seconds remaining on Unit 01.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.23,1:18:06.91,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}With this, I can destroy half of Headquarters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.91,1:18:09.03,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,In his current state, chances are he'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.24,1:18:11.69,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, please listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.69,1:18:13.57,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,If it weren't for Commander Ikari's decision,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.57,1:18:15.71,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,you could've been killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.88,1:18:17.59,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That has nothing to do with it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.59,1:18:19.21,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,But that's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.25,1:18:22.13,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I just say that it has nothing to do with it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.51,1:18:26.03,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,My father, he tried to murder Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.83,1:18:29.05,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,With my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.40,1:18:33.01,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Why?  Why?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.28,1:18:34.56,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Why, damn it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.84,1:18:37.18,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You don't understand anything, Father!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.43,1:18:39.70,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was a fool to believe in you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:43.04,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You should just go and lose someone important to you too, Father!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.04,1:18:44.81,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then{\i0\fscx150} {\r}you'll understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.81,1:18:47.70,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Increase the concentration of the LCL to the limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.28,1:18:50.82,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I have no time to be dealing with a brat's tantrums.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.07,1:18:53.87,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I still have direct control{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.16,1:18:58.16,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.29,1:19:02.06,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it... damn it...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:21.48,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.86,1:19:24.19,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,You're always listening to that, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.57,1:19:25.11,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.88,1:19:28.36,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's something my father used back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.65,1:19:30.82,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like the glasses you have, Ayanami.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.82,1:19:33.61,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Though, he decided he didn't need it anymore, and left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.61,1:19:35.04,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.04,1:19:38.45,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,He left it behind at my teacher's place, so I took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.24,1:19:41.96,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,When I close off my ears, I close off my heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.08,1:19:44.63,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I don't have to face this world I hate.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.98,1:19:46.18,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,World you hate?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.48,1:19:47.29,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.09,1:19:50.05,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A world where the father I hate lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.51,1:19:52.51,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A world with frightening Angels and EVAs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:54.80,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A world that makes you do terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.01,1:19:58.26,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A world where my father no longer needs me now that he has the Dummy Plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.26,1:20:00.72,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,A world where my friends and I are hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.16,1:20:06.03,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Though there are some good things, in the end they are all destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.73,1:20:07.99,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's a world I hate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.42,1:20:10.49,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm rejecting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.61,1:20:15.83,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that my father would protect me from this world I hate if I had this with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.42,1:20:18.53,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But I was just deluding myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.34,1:20:22.49,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you try to understand your father, Ikari-kun?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.75,1:20:23.88,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.53,1:20:26.38,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,But you didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.07,1:20:28.14,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I {\i1}did{\i0\fscx150} {\r}try to!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.22,1:20:30.92,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's Father's fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.12,1:20:33.51,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't it him who abandoned me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.53,1:20:38.20,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,And just like this, you're going to run away from things you hate again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.20,1:20:40.00,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:42.95,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with running away from things you hate?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.40,1:20:47.52,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Here again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.50,1:20:51.48,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,No more...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.31,1:20:58.17,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Vehicles recovering the remnants of Unit 03 should each have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.47,1:21:13.26,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Although all traces of cellular\Ncontamination have disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.46,1:21:16.59,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,we cannot rule out the possibility of mental contamination from the Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.93,1:21:19.18,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Our only option is to keep her quarantined.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.62,1:21:22.23,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,They're not going to kill her, are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.35,1:21:24.06,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a precious specimen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.64,1:21:25.73,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.90,1:21:30.65,eva,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Out you come, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.97,1:21:32.98,eva,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Commander Ikari will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.90,1:21:37.29,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Insubordination.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.29,1:21:38.99,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Private appropriation of an EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.99,1:21:40.69,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Blatant extortion.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.69,1:21:42.79,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,These are all criminal offenses.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.20,1:21:45.41,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have anything to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.10,1:21:49.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.  I don't want to pilot EVA ever again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.91,1:21:50.75,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.00,1:21:52.54,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Then get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.52,1:21:57.13,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,You're running away again?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.78,1:22:05.42,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,You need to sacrifice everything and use\Nyour own strength in order to fulfill your desires.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.42,1:22:07.60,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something others can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.42,1:22:10.69,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji.  Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.06,1:22:15.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it is to be an adult.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.41,1:22:27.78,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's me.  Erase all records of the Third Child.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.78,1:22:31.42,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From now on, Unit 01 will be\Npiloted by the Dummy System.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.42,1:22:33.75,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There will be no need for a backup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.93,1:22:38.05,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Rei didn't stop Shinji-kun from leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.05,1:22:41.55,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,She's changed quite a bit recently, so I was expecting her to.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.55,1:22:44.43,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,We really can't gauge the relationship between the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.43,1:22:47.40,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,But with this, we only have one pilot again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.72,1:22:50.11,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we're back to where we started.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.38,1:22:59.00,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I think you already know this,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.40,1:23:03.50,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,but even though your records have been erased, you will continue to be monitored,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.50,1:23:05.91,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,and your activities will be severely restricted.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.63,1:23:08.45,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.06,1:23:11.92,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Suzuhara-kun and Aida-kun left you several voice messages.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.42,1:23:13.67,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,They're worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.07,1:23:15.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.71,1:23:17.38,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I left it behind on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.10,1:23:20.84,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to know about Rei and Asuka?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.37,1:23:28.81,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, maybe I don't care about things like the fate of humanity and the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.11,1:23:33.14,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I may hold the position I have now,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.35,1:23:38.41,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,but initially it was only because I wanted to be at least a little closer to my deceased father
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.41,1:23:40.11,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,that I joined NERV.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.55,1:23:45.62,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same reason you piloted EVA because Commander Ikari needed you to.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.19,1:23:51.71,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why piled my own feelings and hopes onto you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.44,1:23:55.33,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I knew that they would burden you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.82,1:24:00.21,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I know that you are disappointed with\Nwhat happened when you piloted EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.21,1:24:02.72,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,But even so, I still{\fscx450}-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.76,1:24:14.44,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Rei also invited Commander Ikari that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.92,1:24:18.74,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted you and your father to get along.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.10,1:24:21.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted you both to smile together.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.49,1:24:24.71,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I will never...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.45,1:24:26.87,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,... smile with anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.00,1:24:35.62,eva,Train,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Next stop is Kamigoura, Kamigoura.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.97,1:24:38.09,eva,Train,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please exit on the left.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.84,1:24:45.06,eva,Train,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Japanese government has now declared a state of emergency.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.06,1:24:50.53,eva,Train,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In accordance with emergency regulations, this train will stop at the nearest evacuation station.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.53,1:24:55.55,eva,Train,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please head to the designated platform\Nquickly after alighting and board the incline.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.55,1:24:56.39,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,An Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.19,1:25:06.28,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Brr, it's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.53,1:25:12.48,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It's the new suit alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.48,1:25:15.12,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,My boobs fit perfectly, it feels... great!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.09,1:25:23.67,eva,Kaoru,0000,0000,0000,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.47,1:25:26.73,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All personnel, Battle Stations One.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.73,1:25:28.59,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Prepare for surface-to-air interception.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.76,1:25:29.69,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,The target?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.69,1:25:30.98,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,It's currently advancing forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.98,1:25:33.21,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,It broke through the Old Odawara defense perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.75,1:26:00.20,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That blast must've been huge for the shockwaves to reach even here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.41,1:26:01.90,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}District 4 suffered a direct hit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.90,1:26:02.67,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Losses unknown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.67,1:26:04.63,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,All surface armor systems have been melted!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.63,1:26:07.51,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,It broke through all 24 layers of special armor in one hit...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.84,1:26:11.39,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,So, the Tenth Angel is the strongest rejection-type.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.56,1:26:13.56,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Its destructive power is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.82,1:26:15.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Launch an all-out attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.99,1:26:18.99,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Make use of all anti-invasion facilities within the fortified city!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.99,1:26:21.23,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter by how much, slow it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.15,1:26:25.36,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 02?!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.77,1:26:26.71,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Who's piloting it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.71,1:26:27.40,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unknown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.76,1:26:30.12,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was not us who issued the launch order.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.64,1:26:44.64,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Target intact.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.64,1:26:46.17,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The second wave of N2 mines had no effect.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.17,1:26:48.08,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine.  The evacuation of citizens is top priority!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.08,1:26:51.17,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The third wave of N2 mines has been authorized!  Get them ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.43,1:26:53.76,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The EVAs won't make it in time to intercept it on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.76,1:26:55.22,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Request the cooperation of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.22,1:26:56.89,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Deploy Unit 02 to the Geofront!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.89,1:26:57.76,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What about Unit 00?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.76,1:26:59.31,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The left arm is undergoing emergency treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.31,1:27:00.58,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It should be barely usable!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.58,1:27:03.09,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Once that's done, send it in to assist Unit 02.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.09,1:27:04.38,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Fighting without backup is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.38,1:27:04.89,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.31,1:27:06.18,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What about Unit 01?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.18,1:27:08.19,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It's currently being prepared for\Nactivation with the Dummy System.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.20,1:27:09.66,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:14.39,eva,Civilians,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't that from the city area?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.39,1:27:16.16,eva,Civilians,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.16,1:27:18.40,eva,Civilians,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, the Geofront shelter is right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.69,1:27:18.87,eva alt,Civilians,0000,0000,0000,,My phone's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.40,1:27:20.25,eva,Civilians,0000,0000,0000,,It's the safest place out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.25,1:27:28.39,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,The target is infiltrating Geofront!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.39,1:27:29.93,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 02 is about to engage it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.93,1:27:31.05,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,How is the communication with Unit 02?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.05,1:27:33.67,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The two-way link has been cut, there's nothing we can do...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.84,1:27:35.76,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.73,1:27:38.51,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,So she wants to fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.75,1:27:47.36,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It smells good...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.36,1:27:49.91,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Although this EVA smells of\Nsomeone else, it's not a bad smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.23,1:27:53.36,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,The 5th defense perimeter will be breached soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.61,1:27:56.49,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I better take care of this quickly, or Headquarters will go poof!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.76,1:28:16.06,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Its A.T. field is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.41,1:28:18.60,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,No progress will be made at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.09,1:28:25.60,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.09,1:28:39.22,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,If it's at point-blank...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.05,1:28:55.38,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Owww...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.59,1:28:58.01,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.45,1:29:08.36,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Bastard, not bad at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.36,1:29:10.53,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dummy System has been connected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.53,1:29:12.02,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Start contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.02,1:29:12.61,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.49,1:29:14.08,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.08,1:29:16.07,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The core unit is rejecting the dummy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.07,1:29:19.49,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!  EVA Unit 01 won't activate!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.45,1:29:23.12,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not accepting the dummy?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.86,1:29:24.91,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Fuyutsuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.37,1:29:27.67,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of things for me for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.49,1:29:32.42,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I can't win at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.87,1:29:35.70,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.34,1:29:39.93,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show you the power of an EVA that has abandoned its humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.32,1:29:41.92,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Invert mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.92,1:29:44.56,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Secret code: "The Beast"!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.83,1:29:58.77,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there, EVA Unit 02.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.20,1:30:00.86,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I'll endure it with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.95,1:30:07.49,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,EVA actually has functions like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.49,1:30:09.50,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The limiters are being removed!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.50,1:30:10.91,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,All readings are beyond standards!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.34,1:30:13.01,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Unable to monitor the plug interior!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.01,1:30:13.61,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.61,1:30:15.68,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It's likely that the plug depth has reached negative values.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.68,1:30:18.14,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,This means the pilot was fine with entering the contamination zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.14,1:30:18.80,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.80,1:30:20.26,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.72,1:30:25.22,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing... ventured...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.87,1:30:28.27,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.49,1:30:31.15,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,... gained!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.22,1:30:53.09,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.41,1:31:26.58,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The bestialized second configuration of EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.58,1:31:29.80,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It still couldn't win even after it abandoned its humanity to become combat-specialized.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.37,1:31:32.46,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing more we can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.50,1:31:34.54,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.12,1:31:36.38,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Without a rifle?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.88,1:31:40.71,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.80,1:31:42.05,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Rei, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.35,1:31:43.09,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.07,1:31:49.85,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,A.T. field, full power!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.87,1:31:54.63,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Even if...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.90,1:31:58.61,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Even if Ikari-kun won't pilot EVA, I'll make it alright!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.61,1:31:59.78,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.00,1:32:15.12,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,That A.T. field cannot be broken by a single EVA unit!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.04,1:32:26.83,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 02, this is your final task!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.49,1:32:31.76,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,One... more!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.77,1:32:41.29,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Run, pilot of Unit 02!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.12,1:32:43.11,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.60,1:32:56.71,eva,Hyuga,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Unit 00?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.37,1:33:15.66,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This shelter has been designated as a hazardous zone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.66,1:33:18.35,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please evacuate to a safety zone as soon as possible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.64,1:33:20.33,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I repeat{\fscx450}-{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.10,1:33:32.34,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Owww...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.34,1:33:34.83,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I was pretty close to dying, meow...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.28,1:33:38.42,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.01,1:33:42.50,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I guess this explains why we were short of one unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.12,1:33:44.99,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.44,1:33:48.81,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I've already decided not to pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.01,1:33:55.93,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,So there's actually someone out there who wracks his brains about whether or not to pilot EVA.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.87,1:34:00.02,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, you should hurry up and run.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.02,1:34:02.23,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.32,1:34:08.05,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.05,1:34:10.87,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to pilot...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.87,1:34:16.95,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,You know, you won't have any fun if you keep fretting like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.61,1:35:04.54,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,No way, the Angel consumed the EVA...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:05.86,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.86,1:35:10.22,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,This is strange, the target's identification signal is turning into Unit 00's!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.22,1:35:11.30,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It got us!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.30,1:35:14.70,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Dogma won't self-destruct even if that thing gets inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.70,1:35:16.43,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be able to reach Lilith with no effort!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.05,1:35:19.89,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It's fusing with Unit 00.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.37,1:35:22.90,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,It even absorbed the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.03,1:35:28.32,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,You'll die too, if you don't hurry up and run!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.79,1:35:42.02,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, he left...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.34,1:36:07.92,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Headquarters' ground facilities have been annihilated!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.92,1:36:09.02,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Third foundation has suffered a direct hit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.02,1:36:10.61,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,Final armor plating has been melted!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.61,1:36:11.44,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.44,1:36:13.32,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The main shaft is completely exposed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.82,1:36:14.95,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 isn't ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.00,1:36:20.47,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unable to fix plug to entry position!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.47,1:36:22.50,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's rejecting the signal to connect the Dummy System!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.70,1:36:23.49,eva alt,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good, resetting it doesn't help!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.49,1:36:24.61,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:26.75,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Start again from 308.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.00,1:36:28.67,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}List 308...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.00,1:36:29.88,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.25,1:36:33.38,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you refusing me, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.71,1:36:35.01,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Let me pilot it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.73,1:36:38.18,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.55,1:36:40.60,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,... let me pilot Unit 01!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.86,1:36:46.53,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.48,1:36:50.16,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.88,1:36:54.23,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I am the pilot of Evangelion Unit 01...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.59,1:36:55.82,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari Shinji!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.01,1:37:02.52,eva,Aoba,0000,0000,0000,,The target has descended past seventh layer of Terminal Dogma!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.88,1:37:06.03,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.03,1:37:07.21,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,All noncombatants, evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.54,1:37:09.03,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All noncombatants are to evacuate immediately!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.03,1:37:10.91,eva,Tech,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I repeat, all noncombatants are to evacuate{\fscx450}-{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.52,1:37:24.65,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 01?!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.86,1:37:26.78,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.75,1:37:50.50,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.50,1:37:52.34,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Release the locks!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.29,1:38:21.57,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Out of energy?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.57,1:38:23.53,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 has reached the end of its active time limit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.53,1:38:25.22,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,The backup reserves are depleted, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.22,1:38:26.16,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.86,1:38:43.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.23,1:38:50.77,eva,shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Give Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.97,1:38:52.81,eva,shinji,0000,0000,0000,,... back to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.13,1:38:58.32,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,It's moving?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.65,1:39:01.20,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,But it should be at the end of its active time limit...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.95,1:39:03.87,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's going berserk?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.07,1:39:05.08,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.56,1:39:08.58,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,What on Earth is happening with Unit 01?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.04,1:39:56.71,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Such power in an EVA...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.02,1:40:00.05,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Has Unit 01 transcended human limits?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.64,1:40:03.05,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Plug depth is over 180!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.05,1:40:04.43,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Reaching critical levels!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.43,1:40:05.76,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop, Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.89,1:40:07.72,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be able to become human again!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.76,1:40:10.60,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What happens to me doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.02,1:40:13.53,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,What happens to the world doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.53,1:40:14.81,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,But, Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.91,1:40:17.69,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,At least Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.25,1:40:19.57,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll definitely save her!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.50,1:40:35.08,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it, Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.08,1:40:35.62,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Misato?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.38,1:40:38.75,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't for someone else!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.21,1:40:42.55,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,It's for the sake of your own wishes!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.72,1:40:55.73,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.15,1:40:58.15,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.94,1:41:02.30,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no longer able to live anywhere else but here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.30,1:41:03.15,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.56,1:41:05.36,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, Ikari-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.86,1:41:08.16,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I disappear, I'll be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.16,1:41:09.53,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be replaced...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.53,1:41:10.70,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.70,1:41:12.24,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,There's no other Ayanami but you!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.08,1:41:15.16,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I'll save you now!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.32,1:41:34.62,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.18,1:41:37.97,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Its physical limiters are disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.97,1:41:39.20,eva,Maya,0000,0000,0000,,Analysis impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.41,1:41:44.28,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Breaking free of the human limits that restricted it,\Nthe EVA now returns to its original form.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.64,1:41:46.97,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It has dissolved the curse humans have placed on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.97,1:41:50.57,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,and has exceeded humans to transform into a near-Godlike existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.39,1:41:56.25,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Inside the huge waves of complementarity,\Nit spins Heaven, Earth, and all creation together,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.25,1:42:00.08,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,transforming itself into a condensed energy form.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.04,1:42:04.42,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It's doing that to grant the wish of one human being.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.01,1:42:06.63,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Just for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.79,1:42:37.25,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.11,1:42:56.15,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.30,1:43:19.54,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!  Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.00,1:43:24.92,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.68,1:44:03.96,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 was triggered before the rest of the units were ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.63,1:44:08.46,eva,Kaji,0000,0000,0000,,Commander Ikari, SEELE won't be quiet about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.32,1:44:13.43,eva,Fuyutsuki,0000,0000,0000,,As we thought, the two of them\Nwere enough to awaken Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.43,1:44:14.38,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.69,1:44:19.14,eva,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little more until our project is complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.45,1:44:26.41,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, about my father...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.15,1:44:28.19,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.69,1:44:29.82,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.44,1:44:31.82,eva,Rei,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.87,1:44:34.20,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.11,1:44:37.57,eva,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.79,1:44:48.08,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.08,1:44:50.12,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,He's quite the convenient fellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.77,1:44:53.64,eva,Mari,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's because he smelled different?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.00,1:45:31.30,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,This is the birth of a new life that\Ntranscends the logos of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.46,1:45:36.11,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The cost of it is the elimination of older life.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.66,1:45:42.56,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.68,1:45:45.52,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Just like 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.22,1:45:48.23,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.47,1:45:50.73,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,It's the continuation of the Second Impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.73,1:45:52.86,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The Third Impact has begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.09,1:45:56.03,eva,Ritsuko,0000,0000,0000,,The world is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.39,1:51:17.68,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,What on Earth was that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.60,1:51:25.86,eva,Kaoru,0000,0000,0000,,Now, the Promised time has come, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.22,1:51:29.45,eva,Kaoru,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I'll definitely...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.11,1:51:31.90,eva,Kaoru,0000,0000,0000,,... make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.89,1:51:38.87,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 01 is immobilized with Rei and Shinji still trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.16,1:51:40.50,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The fortified city in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.75,1:51:42.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The NERV personnel imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.58,1:51:44.75,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,EVA Unit 06 descends at Dogma.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.00,1:51:47.29,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The quickening EVA Unit 08 and its pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.75,1:51:50.21,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,The children chosen by fate finally assemble.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.71,1:51:54.97,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,How will this tale of people who wish to survive play out?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.32,1:51:58.57,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,Next, on Evangelion New Theatrical Version: Q!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.57,1:52:01.98,eva,Misato,0000,0000,0000,,There'll also be plenty of fanservice!
