Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.95,1:14:38.11,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(200,200)}Let's stay friends
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.11,1:14:43.89,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Forever and ever
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.40,1:14:51.96,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}We'll dream of tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.96,1:14:58.32,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}And walk the road of hope
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.72,1:15:06.88,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}We will live freely
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.88,1:15:12.60,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Like a bird flying in the sky
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.19,1:15:20.70,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Today, we say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.70,1:15:26.98,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Until the day we meet again
