Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.03,1:16:24.85,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Of believing in each other
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.12,1:16:32.73,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Today, we say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.73,1:16:38.74,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Until the day we meet again
