Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.11,1:14:43.89,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\fs32}友達でいよう
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.40,1:14:51.96,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\fs32}明日の日は夢見て
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.96,1:14:58.32,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\fs32}希望の道を
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.72,1:15:06.88,insert1,Gendou,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\fs32}空を飛ぶ 鳥のように
