Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.85,1:41:49.00,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}If you could grant my wish
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.00,1:41:56.20,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}I'd wish for wings
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.20,1:42:08.92,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Please place white wings on my back
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.39,1:42:26.05,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Just like a bird's
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.20,1:42:33.08,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}I want to spread my wings
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.08,1:42:39.75,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}And fly off into the wide sky
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.75,1:42:46.78,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}Towards the sky, free and without sorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.78,1:42:57.34,insert2,Shinji,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1}I will beat my wings and fly
